{"type":"message","id":"108bd019","parentId":"c6e5714d","timestamp":"2026-02-12T15:22:08.723Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"### Task Execution Plan:\n\n#### 1. **Write automated tests**\n   - Review the existing test suite and identify gaps to cover backward compatibility for non-AI indicators.\n   - Add test cases to ensure existing non-AI indicators behave correctly after changes.\n\n#### 2. **Develop code for backward compatibility**\n   - Implement changes in the codebase to ensure non-AI indicators' behavior remains consistent without disruptions to existing functionalities.\n   - Refactor methods or introduce adapters/middleware if necessary.\n\n#### 3. **Verify tests locally**\n   - Run the updated test suite locally to ensure all backward compatibility checks pass.\n\n#### 4. **Git push changes**\n   - Commit changes with clear and descriptive messages.\n   - Push the changes to the repository.\n\n#### 5. **Ensure successful automated tests in production**\n   - Monitor the CI pipeline for successful execution and investigate potential issues, if any.\n\n---\n\nI'll start by exploring the current state of the project files, especially those related to tests. Let me do that."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_IRtZxYuDcCwU1MDWlNyNqVdL","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls","workdir":"C:\\Users\\Raitis\\.openclaw\\workspace"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"github-copilot","model":"gpt-4o","usage":{"input":6159,"output":238,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":6397,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770909725263}}
