{"type":"message","id":"f9291a19","parentId":"57c0ebf1","timestamp":"2026-02-12T15:23:00.197Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The `BaseIndicator.js` file defines a `BaseIndicator` class, which serves as a generic foundation for creating SEO indicator analyzers. However, it doesn't define specific functionality or indicators.\n\nTo enable the `NonAIIndicatorCompatibilityTest`, I'll need to create a `NonAIIndicator` class that extends `BaseIndicator` and implements the expected `analyze` method for the `keyword-density` functionality.\n\nLet me first implement the `NonAIIndicator` class."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_FIapU05f6UYowpODYhJDluj0","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"// Non-AI indicator analyzer for keyword density\n\nconst BaseIndicator = require('./BaseIndicator');\n\nclass NonAIIndicator extends BaseIndicator {\n  constructor(name) {\n    super(name);\n  }\n\n  analyze(data) {\n    if (!data) return {};\n\n    const words = data.split(/\\s+/);\n    const wordCounts = words.reduce((counts, word) => {\n      word = word.toLowerCase();\n      counts[word] = (counts[word] || 0) + 1;\n      return counts;\n    }, {});\n\n    const keyword = this.name;\n    return {\n      keyword,\n      density: ((wordCounts[keyword] || 0) / words.length) * 100,\n    };\n  }\n}\n\nmodule.exports = NonAIIndicator;","path":"src/indicators/NonAIIndicator.js"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"github-copilot","model":"gpt-4o","usage":{"input":229,"output":305,"cacheRead":11008,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11542,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770909774569}}
